    title: 'International Trade Expo Jakarta 2025: Connecting Nigeria & Indonesia',
    excerpt: 'KASCOTE participated in the Indonesia International Trade Expo 2025, showcasing Nigerian business opportunities and building bridges with international traders.',
    content: 'The International Trade Expo in Jakarta presented a unique opportunity for KASCOTE to establish the presence of Nigerian businesses in one of Southeast Asia\'s largest markets. Our delegation participated alongside prominent international exhibitors, positioning Kano\'s entrepreneurs on the global stage.\n\n40th Trade Expo Indonesia 2025 - Record-Breaking Success\n\nThe 40th Trade Expo Indonesia (TEI) 2025 was held from October 15–19, 2025, at the Indonesia Convention Exhibition (ICE) BSD City, achieving unprecedented success with the theme "Discover Indonesia\'s Excellence: Trade Beyond Boundaries".\n\nEvent Impact\n- Total Exhibitors: 1,619 companies\n- International Visitors: Over 34,550 from 131 countries\n- Transaction Value: USD 22.8 billion\n- Product Categories: Food & Agricultural Products, Manufacturing Products, Services & Lifestyle\n\nStrategic Significance\n\nThe expo reinforced Indonesia\'s critical role in global value chains and aligned with President Prabowo\'s Asta Cita vision for downstream industrialization. It featured business matching services, seminars, and the prestigious Primaduta Award for foreign partners.\n\nKASCOTE Participation and Outcomes\n\n- Connected with 50+ international businesses\n- Signed preliminary agreements for trade partnerships\n- Generated inquiries for Nigerian products\n- Explored distribution opportunities in Southeast Asia\n- Engaged with representatives from 131 countries\n- Identified 15+ potential Indonesian suppliers\n- Gathered market intelligence on emerging product trends\n\nStrategic Value for Members\n\n- Direct access to world-class Indonesian products\n- Opportunities for value-added distribution\n- Foundation for retail and wholesale expansion\n- Support for business growth and market expansion\n- Strengthened Nigeria-Indonesia bilateral trade ties\n- Network connections across multiple sectors\n\nConclusion\n\nThe 40th Trade Expo Indonesia 2025 exemplified the power of international trade exhibitions to connect businesses and drive economic growth. KASCOTE\'s participation positioned our members to access reliable suppliers and establish sustainable business relationships, opening new doors for expansion into Asian markets.',
