    title: 'Kano Indonesian Trade Expo 2024: Organised by KASCOTE in Kano Nigeria',
    excerpt: 'KASCOTE organized the Indonesia Expo 2024 in Kano State in collaboration with the Indonesian Embassy Nigeria, showcasing over 107 Indonesian enterprises and fostering bilateral trade.',
    content: 'The Indonesia Expo 2024 was held in Kano State, Nigeria from August 20-24, 2024, organized by KASCOTE in collaboration with the Indonesian Embassy. Over 107 Indonesian companies participated, showcasing products in agriculture, technology, fashion, food, manufacturing, beauty, education, and pharmaceuticals. Key participants included Dexa Medica and other leading enterprises. The event created direct business connections between Nigerian and Indonesian traders, established import-export partnerships, and provided access to quality Indonesian products. Nigerian entrepreneurs gained market intelligence and identified long-term supplier relationships. The expo demonstrated Indonesia\'s manufacturing capabilities and created a foundation for expanded bilateral commerce. Kano\'s business community benefited through diverse product sourcing, partnership opportunities, and sustainable trade relationships with Indonesian enterprises.',
