    id: '27',
    title: 'Award Presentation: Indonesian Business Community Honours Khairun Vice Chancellor',
    excerpt: 'The Vice Chancellor of Khalifa Isyaka Rabiu University (Khairun) received recognition and an award from Indonesian business and trade communities for supporting international business education and partnerships.',
    content: 'In recognition of his outstanding contributions to fostering international business partnerships and supporting educational excellence, the Vice Chancellor of Khalifa Isyaka Rabiu University (Khairun) received a prestigious award from the Indonesian business and trade communities. This recognition underscores the university\'s commitment to global engagement and the critical role of academic leadership in advancing bilateral business relations between Nigeria and Indonesia.\n\nThe award presentation highlighted the Vice Chancellor\'s efforts in:\n- Creating pathways for international business partnerships\n- Supporting student exchange and capacity building programs\n- Facilitating trade and business seminars with international partners\n- Strengthening academic-business sector collaboration\n- Promoting Nigeria-Indonesia educational cooperation\n\nThis honor reflects Khairun\'s position as a leading institution in promoting entrepreneurship and international trade, and the appreciation of Indonesian business communities for the university\'s role in supporting trilateral and bilateral commerce initiatives.',
