    title: 'KASCOTE at International Food Show Africa 2024 in Tunisia',
    excerpt: 'KASCOTE delegation led by President Alhaji Hassan Tahir Yaro participated in the International Food Show Africa (IFSA) 2024 in Tunisia, showcasing Nigerian food products and establishing trade connections.',
    content: 'KASCOTE participated in the prestigious International Food Show Africa (IFSA) 2024 held in Tunisia, with a delegation led by President Alhaji Hassan Tahir Yaro. The event provided an exceptional platform for Nigerian traders to showcase their food products, network with African and international buyers, and explore export opportunities.\n\nEvent Overview\n\nIFSA 2024 is one of Africa\'s leading food and beverage exhibitions, attracting exhibitors, distributors, retailers, and importers from across the continent and beyond. The show focused on food innovation, quality products, and fostering business partnerships across African markets.\n\nKASCOTE\'s Participation\n\nOur delegation showcased: Nigerian food and agricultural products, quality standards and certifications, production capabilities, business partnership opportunities. The participation strengthened KASCOTE\'s position in regional food trade and opened new markets for member products.\n\nOutcomes\n\nThe delegation engaged with numerous international buyers, explored distribution channels for Nigerian products, learned about market trends and consumer preferences, and established contacts for future collaborations.\n\nFuture Prospects\n\nParticipation in IFSA 2024 has positioned KASCOTE members to access African markets, strengthen their competitive positioning, and create sustainable business relationships in the food and beverage sector.',
