    excerpt: 'KASCOTE led by President Alhaji Hassan Tahir Yaro visited the Nigerian Export Promotion Council (NEPC) to explore collaboration opportunities and strengthen support for member export activities.',
    content: 'KASCOTE, led by President Alhaji Hassan Tahir Yaro, visited the Nigerian Export Promotion Council (NEPC), Nigeria\'s premier export promotion agency. The visit aimed to strengthen collaboration between KASCOTE and NEPC in supporting export development and international trade activities.\n\nAbout NEPC\n\nThe Nigerian Export Promotion Council is the official government agency responsible for promoting and facilitating Nigerian exports. NEPC provides services, support, and advocacy to help Nigerian businesses expand their international presence and compete in global markets.\n\nPurpose of the Visit\n\nThe delegation visited NEPC to: explore export support programs available to KASCOTE members, discuss collaboration on trade promotion initiatives, seek NEPC\'s support for member businesses entering international markets, strengthen partnership between KASCOTE and the export promotion agency. This engagement aligned with KASCOTE\'s mission of advancing international trade.\n\nDiscussions\n\nTopics covered included: export financing and insurance programs, market research and information services, capacity building for exporters, participation in international trade fairs and exhibitions, certification and standards support for export products.\n\nOutcome\n\nThe visit reinforced KASCOTE\'s commitment to facilitating structured export development for member businesses and positioned the organization as a key stakeholder in Nigeria\'s export promotion efforts.',
